    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d168">

                <pb facs="0312" n="224" sameAs="frus:frus1892/pg224"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Blaine to Mr.
                            Lincoln.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1892-01-14"><hi rendition="#italic">January 14,
                        1892</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Express deep regret and sincere condolences of the President by reason of the
                    lamented death of the Duke of Clarence and Avondale.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Blaine.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
